OL,3,GNEWSAWarning issued after fraudsters
OL,4,Aimpersonate police
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Mercia Police has issued a warning
OL,7,Fafter the force received multiple
OL,8,Freports of fraudsters impersonating
OL,9,Fpolice officers.
OL,11,FThree incidents were reported in
OL,12,FHerefordshire ` two in Hereford and one
OL,13,Fin Ross-on-Wye ` while another was
OL,14,Freported in Tenbury Wells,
OL,15,FWorcestershire.
OL,17,FIn each incident, the con artists
OL,18,Fclaimed to be a "Detective Warren
OL,19,FMason" or "Detective Mason Warren" from
OL,20,F"Brixon Police".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
