OL,3,GNEWSAWarning issued after fraudsters
OL,4,Aimpersonate police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 20s was arrested on
OL,7,FThursday on suspicion of attempted
OL,8,Ffraud in connection with the incident
OL,9,Fin Ross-on-Wye. He remains helping
OL,10,Fofficers with their enquiries.
